            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 47527,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "We need to be more specific than that. The 'Corrective Actions' column in A2 should explicitly state the first one or two steps, e.g., '1. Rerun QC material. 2. If fails again, use new vial of QC material. 3. If still fails, notify supervisor and place 'Out of Service' sign on analyser'. This removes guesswork and ensures a standard response.",
